| `commit subject matcher` | `scripts/commit_subject.py` supplies one pure subject matcher shared by the message-file CLI and the history gate. | `python3 scripts/commit_subject.py --message-file PATH` | [`commit_subject.types`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`commit_subject.scope_chars`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`commit_subject.adoption_boundary`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Does not judge bodies or install a hook. Unreadable messages exit USAGE; malformed policy exits CONFIG. | [Deterministic checks](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
